22. The simplest way to use the project

If you are new to the code, remember only this workflow:

1. Open the terminal in analyst-model.
2. Test with --mock.
3. Pull a new company with --live only when you need new data.
4. Never repull a company whose CSVs already exist unless you intentionally need newer or deeper data.
5. Build its Excel workbook with export_to_excel.py.
6. Combine existing companies with --from-outputs for zero API calls.
7. Watch industries and valid NN predictions.
8. Run FF5 only when the multi company dataset is large enough.

The most important distinction is:

--live          = can use FactSet requests
--mock          = zero FactSet requests, synthetic test data
--from-outputs  = zero FactSet requests, your already downloaded real data

That distinction will prevent most accidental API usage.

